# Good AI Assessment Engine

**Deterministic AI readiness scoring for enterprise transformation**

A production-grade CLI tool that implements Good AI's "Enterprise AI Readiness Assessment" methodology. Evidence-based scoring with fully transparent, auditable logic.

## Quickstart

```bash
git clone https://github.com/rogermsc/enterprise-ai-2026
cd enterprise-ai-2026
pip install -e .
goodai-assess data/enterprise_mature.json
```

## Features

- **Fully Offline**: No network calls or external API dependencies
- **Deterministic Scoring**: Same input always produces same output
- **Transparent Methodology**: All scoring rules are auditable
- **Rich Terminal Output**: Beautiful formatted reports with progress bars
- **JSON Export**: Machine-readable output for integration

## Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/rogermsc/enterprise-ai-2026
cd enterprise-ai-2026

# Install in development mode
pip install -e .

# Or install with dev dependencies for testing
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Usage

### Basic Usage

```bash
# Pretty terminal output (default)
goodai-assess data/enterprise_mature.json

# JSON output for automation
goodai-assess data/enterprise_mature.json --json

# Show version
goodai-assess --version
```

