│   ├── test_schema.py       # Validation tests
│   ├── test_scoring.py      # Scoring tests
│   └── test_tiers.py        # Tier boundary tests
├── pyproject.toml
├── LICENSE
└── README.md
```

## Exit Codes

| Code | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| 0 | Success |
| 1 | Schema validation error |
| 2 | File not found or invalid JSON |

